WEBVTT

00:08.660 --> 00:10.650
Guess it's almost time...

00:12.520 --> 00:13.660
Himuro-kun.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.270
Good morning.

00:18.660 --> 00:21.250
I'm sorry. Were you waiting long?

00:21.670 --> 00:22.650
Good morning!

00:22.440 --> 00:24.040
<i>Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

00:22.650 --> 00:23.840
Fuyutsuki-san!

00:23.840 --> 00:24.640
As pretty as ever!

00:24.040 --> 00:25.730
G-Good morning.

00:24.640 --> 00:25.710
Yay!

00:25.730 --> 00:28.340
I'm sorry to make you wait 
in the cold like this.

00:28.340 --> 00:31.670
Not at all. I'm well-attuned 
to the cold, after all.

00:35.930 --> 00:39.220
