<b>Episode 12


 Their Night Together and the Morning Spring Came</b>

03:22.010 --> 03:24.990
This business trip is a big 
responsibility, isn't it?

03:22.010 --> 03:29.020
<b>Blu-ray & DVD on Sale!</b>

03:24.990 --> 03:26.030
Yes.

03:26.030 --> 03:28.340
The chief is really counting on us.

03:29.390 --> 03:31.160
A business trip?

03:31.160 --> 03:31.760
Yes.

03:32.130 --> 03:35.840
It's for that big project 
you've been working on.

03:35.840 --> 03:38.010
I'd like you to stay overnight...

03:38.010 --> 03:39.240
Yes, sir.

03:39.240 --> 03:46.030
...with your partner on 
the project, Fuyutsuki-san.

03:46.880 --> 03:48.320
<i>The heck did he say?!</i>

03:48.320 --> 03:50.760
<i>Me and Fuyutsuki-san, overnight?!</i>

03:52.700 --> 03:54.710
I expect a lot out of you.

03:56.010 --> 03:59.040
<i>I'm so sorry, Chief Budda...</i>

03:59.040 --> 04:01.880
<i>I'll work hard to meet your expectations!</i>

03:59.050 --> 04:03.050
<b>Blu-ray & DVD on Sale!</b>

04:07.000 --> 04:08.060
That reminds me.

04:08.500 --> 04:10.990
Are you leaving Nyamero-san 
home alone again?

04:10.990 --> 04:12.060
Yes.

04:12.060 --> 04:15.810
I don't need to hire a sitter 
for just one night away.

04:15.810 --> 04:19.440
I put Nyamero's favorite kibble down,

04:20.320 --> 04:23.560
and we played together a lot before I left.

04:24.810 --> 04:26.480
Nyamero-san!

04:27.080 --> 04:31.580
I think Nyamero really likes you.

04:27.500 --> 04:29.760
This way! Go!

04:29.760 --> 04:31.580
And again!

04:32.560 --> 04:33.780
Really?

04:33.780 --> 04:35.480
I hope you'll come visit us again.

04:35.490 --> 04:37.120
Of course I will!

04:37.120 --> 04:38.840
Same to you.

04:38.840 --> 04:39.790
Of course.

04:45.260 --> 04:46.170
Oh...

04:46.840 --> 04:47.970
That reminds me.

04:47.970 --> 04:51.310
Apparently the hotel we're staying 
at doesn't serve dinner.

04:52.080 --> 04:54.250
Would you like to go out somewhere to eat?

04:54.250 --> 04:56.850
Or would you like to make do 
with convenience store food?

04:57.840 --> 05:01.360
I actually scouted a few restaurants.

05:05.240 --> 05:07.610
<b>Charcoal-Grilled Beef Tongue</b>

05:05.480 --> 05:07.120
What do you think of this?

05:08.880 --> 05:10.240
It sounds good.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.650
Looks like it's close to the hotel, as well.

05:12.650 --> 05:14.360
That's great.

05:14.360 --> 05:16.050
This business trip...

05:16.620 --> 05:20.900
It has a fairly grueling schedule, 
and I'm unfamiliar with the area,

05:20.900 --> 05:23.200
so I was feeling rather nervous...

05:25.130 --> 05:28.310
But I feel more confident, 
knowing you'll be with me.

05:30.320 --> 05:32.330
<i>She trusts me!</i>

05:35.180 --> 05:37.130
I'll get us a reservation.

05:37.130 --> 05:39.130
I appreciate it.

05:39.710 --> 05:41.140
<i>Yes!</i>

05:43.640 --> 05:47.150
<i>I'm gonna work hard, get through this job,</i>

05:47.150 --> 05:49.640
<i>and have a nice dinner with Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

06:15.710 --> 06:17.540
<i>It's goin' great!</i>

06:20.400 --> 06:23.580
<i>Today's a day I can do no wrong!</i>

06:25.440 --> 06:27.080
<i>No wrong!</i>

06:35.960 --> 06:37.210
Himuro-kun?

06:37.940 --> 06:39.470
Are you all right?

06:39.470 --> 06:42.060
Oh... I'm fine.

06:42.060 --> 06:44.210
I'm just a bit tired.

06:44.210 --> 06:45.510
Are you sure?

06:45.510 --> 06:47.580
You sneezed this morning as well,

06:47.580 --> 06:50.360
and that long meeting was very draining.

06:50.360 --> 06:54.220
If you're not feeling well, 
we could cancel our dinner...

06:54.220 --> 06:55.880
No, please...

06:55.880 --> 07:01.090
<i>Like heck I'd pass up a chance to try
 the local cuisine with Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

07:01.870 --> 07:03.360
I'm fine, really—

07:11.480 --> 07:12.970
Himuro-kun?

07:14.280 --> 07:15.500
Um...

07:23.000 --> 07:24.580
You're burning up.

07:24.580 --> 07:26.720
That explains why you melted again.

07:26.720 --> 07:28.410
I'm sorry.

07:28.410 --> 07:33.010
As a snow woman descendant, when
 I get overheated, I can't help myself...

07:33.010 --> 07:37.400
<i>Still, what an awful time 
to come down with a fever...</i>

07:38.520 --> 07:40.440
Let's get you cooled down.

07:40.880 --> 07:45.520
I'll buy you some ice or ice cream
 like I did in Okinawa.

07:52.250 --> 07:53.850
That won't work.

07:53.850 --> 07:58.130
When I'm sick, I just have to wait 
until the fever goes down.

07:58.130 --> 07:59.880
I see. That makes sense.

07:59.880 --> 08:01.880
Let's get you back to the hotel, then.

08:03.370 --> 08:05.030
Don't push yourself too hard.

08:05.030 --> 08:08.120
I'll call the restaurant myself.

08:08.120 --> 08:09.520
Please, no...

08:11.130 --> 08:13.130
Come on, Himuro-kun.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.720
Let's go.

08:16.720 --> 08:19.620
It's not safe for little kids 
to walk alone at night.

08:19.620 --> 08:20.890
Little kids?!

08:29.400 --> 08:30.640
<i>But...</i>

08:35.400 --> 08:38.280
<i>Getting a fever on a business trip...</i>

08:41.410 --> 08:43.820
<i>I guess it is pretty childish.</i>

08:46.680 --> 08:47.920
Come on.

08:47.920 --> 08:49.920
S-Sorry.

08:56.430 --> 08:57.250
Um...

08:57.250 --> 09:00.120
We'll share this room for the night.

09:00.120 --> 09:00.890
Huh?!

09:01.680 --> 09:04.870
I can't leave you alone with a fever.

09:05.300 --> 09:08.190
I'll look after you tonight.

09:08.190 --> 09:10.690
B-But...

09:12.100 --> 09:14.810
You can take the bed, Himuro-kun.

09:14.810 --> 09:16.810
I'll sleep on the sofa.

09:16.810 --> 09:19.690
No, no! I'm fine on my own!

09:19.690 --> 09:21.460
I can't agree to that.

09:22.730 --> 09:25.030
At least let me take the sofa...

09:25.030 --> 09:27.640
Or I'll stay in my own room!

09:29.780 --> 09:32.330
Not in that condition, you won't.

09:32.330 --> 09:34.110
But... I...

09:34.110 --> 09:35.730
I promise it'll be all right.

09:35.730 --> 09:37.720
Please, relax.

10:19.270 --> 10:21.030
S-Sorry!

10:21.030 --> 10:21.960
Not at all.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.720
H-Hello?

10:26.720 --> 10:28.020
Sorry about that, Chief!

10:30.040 --> 10:33.120
Yes, the presentation went well.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.390
Y-Yes.

10:34.390 --> 10:37.030
I'll report in right away.

10:37.380 --> 10:39.630
What? My voice sounds strange?

10:39.630 --> 10:42.780
I'm a little under the weather...

10:42.780 --> 10:45.800
Y-Yes, thank you.

10:45.800 --> 10:47.240
Excuse me.

10:50.170 --> 10:51.300
Himuro-kun?

10:51.300 --> 10:52.790
Y-Yes?

10:53.040 --> 10:55.570
Has your fever gone up?

10:55.570 --> 10:58.040
No, I'm fine.

10:59.560 --> 11:02.550
Don't be like that. Please get in bed.

11:02.550 --> 11:04.600
But the report...

11:05.560 --> 11:09.060
I'll write the report and send it in.

11:18.680 --> 11:20.520
I'm sorry about this.

11:21.200 --> 11:22.880
Really, it's nothing.

11:26.480 --> 11:28.200
I sent it out.

11:28.200 --> 11:30.690
I'm truly sorry.

11:30.690 --> 11:32.110
Don't worry about it.

11:32.110 --> 11:34.710
Can I buy you something, though?

11:34.710 --> 11:38.370
Something easy to eat with 
a fever... Gelatin, perhaps?

11:38.370 --> 11:40.120
Please.

11:40.120 --> 11:42.200
I'll be back soon, then.

11:42.200 --> 11:44.300
Call me if something comes up.

11:44.300 --> 11:45.720
Take care.

12:05.020 --> 12:07.960
<i>What'd I even come here for?</i>

12:07.960 --> 12:09.840
<i>I mean, to do work, of course.</i>

12:09.840 --> 12:13.730
<i>And the work part went great, but...</i>

12:13.730 --> 12:16.830
<i>I've got Fuyutsuki-san lending me her bed,</i>

12:16.830 --> 12:18.850
<i>and even runnin' errands for me...</i>

12:21.250 --> 12:23.760
<i>I've done nothin' but embarrass 
myself in front of her.</i>

12:28.260 --> 12:31.860
<i>I'll bet she's sick of me by now.</i>

12:33.030 --> 12:35.920
<i>I'm so pathetic when I'm sick.</i>

12:36.190 --> 12:39.690
<i>Cut it out! You gotta sleep and get better!</i>

12:41.770 --> 12:44.520
<i>Himuro-kun felt so warm.</i>

12:51.790 --> 12:54.790
<i>I hope his fever passes all right.</i>

12:58.020 --> 12:59.390
Excuse me.

13:00.800 --> 13:02.470
<i>I wasn't paying attention.</i>

13:04.300 --> 13:08.600
<i>Himuro-kun's in such bad shape. 
I have to get back quickly.</i>

13:14.180 --> 13:15.560
I'm back.

13:23.010 --> 13:24.350
Himuro-kun...

13:37.990 --> 13:39.640
He's adorable when he's sleeping.

13:44.710 --> 13:48.720
I hope you feel better soon.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.880
<i>I'm back to normal.</i>

14:06.170 --> 14:07.450
<i>Fuyutsuki-san...</i>

14:07.450 --> 14:09.650
<i>She really is sleepin' on the sofa.</i>

14:10.240 --> 14:11.770
<i>I feel so bad.</i>

14:14.350 --> 14:17.610
<i>I'd like to give her the bed back...</i>

14:19.000 --> 14:21.480
<i>But I don't wanna wake her.</i>

14:26.910 --> 14:29.000
<i>I'm starin' at her as she sleeps...</i>

14:39.500 --> 14:41.520
<i>I'm gettin' way too close!</i>

14:41.520 --> 14:44.750
<i>I got too enchanted by her sleepin' face...</i>

14:46.860 --> 14:49.600
<i>I gotta keep up boundaries as a colleague!</i>

15:03.550 --> 15:06.070
Good morning, Himuro-kun.

15:06.540 --> 15:08.500
You're grown up again, I see.

15:08.500 --> 15:09.550
I'm so glad.

15:10.560 --> 15:12.630
Good morning.

15:12.630 --> 15:15.810
I'm so sorry about all 
the trouble last night.

15:15.810 --> 15:18.590
You're looking under the weather again.

15:18.590 --> 15:20.560
You have bags under your eyes.

15:21.270 --> 15:23.160
Oh, this is just...

15:23.160 --> 15:26.100
I was writing a follow-up 
email to the client,

15:26.100 --> 15:27.830
so I didn't get enough sleep...

15:29.030 --> 15:30.390
Don't tell me...

15:30.390 --> 15:33.450
you felt bad about using the bed 
while I was on the couch,

15:33.450 --> 15:36.340
so you stayed up all night working?

15:36.340 --> 15:37.210
Erk!

15:37.210 --> 15:38.200
Of course not.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.830
Really?

15:39.830 --> 15:41.830
A-Absolutely.

15:41.830 --> 15:44.200
I think that's exactly what happened.

15:45.850 --> 15:49.670
<i>Fuyutsuki-san always reads me like a book.</i>

15:53.180 --> 15:55.840
Are you hungry?

15:57.350 --> 15:58.440
Oh...

15:58.440 --> 16:00.820
You haven't eaten anything, either?

16:00.820 --> 16:02.080
Let's get some food.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.300
I bought a lot from the convenience store,

16:04.300 --> 16:06.870
and there's coffee in the hotel.

16:12.450 --> 16:14.970
It feels a bit like a picnic, doesn't it?

16:14.970 --> 16:16.860
An early morning picnic.

16:16.860 --> 16:17.950
Yes.

16:17.950 --> 16:21.270
An extremely memorable meal 
for our business trip.

16:21.270 --> 16:23.310
And the work went well, too.

16:23.310 --> 16:24.270
It did.

16:29.120 --> 16:32.520
We'll need to report to the chief 
the minute we get back.

16:32.520 --> 16:37.400
The email you sent to the client 
should buy us some time.

16:45.940 --> 16:49.160
<i>Ah, it's all over.</i>

16:49.150 --> 16:52.820
<b>Asakusa Station</b>

16:49.820 --> 16:53.640
<i>No more fun time together...</i>

16:55.520 --> 16:57.160
<i>Too bad.</i>

16:58.120 --> 17:00.520
<i>Wish we coulda had longer.</i>

17:09.800 --> 17:11.370
The cherry blossoms...

17:16.710 --> 17:19.370
They weren't blooming 
before the trip, were they?

17:19.370 --> 17:20.320
No.

17:26.120 --> 17:27.680
It was around here, wasn't it?

17:30.220 --> 17:33.030
My legs froze up and I couldn't move.

17:33.030 --> 17:34.780
It was quite a surprise.

17:35.690 --> 17:41.540
I'd never seen someone literally 
freeze up from nervousness.

17:41.990 --> 17:44.460
I really appreciated the help.

17:44.460 --> 17:47.220
It was nothing, truly.

17:59.090 --> 18:01.900
It's been a year since then, hasn't it?

18:01.900 --> 18:02.970
Yes.

18:04.930 --> 18:07.530
A truly eventful year.

18:37.590 --> 18:38.470
<b>Nyamero</b>

18:37.590 --> 18:38.470
<b></b>New Friends: 1

18:37.590 --> 18:38.470
<b>Himuro</b>

18:37.590 --> 18:38.470
<b></b>Groups

18:37.590 --> 18:38.470
<b></b>Make a group

18:39.800 --> 18:40.680
<b></b>Good evening to mew

18:57.280 --> 18:58.490
<b>George the Kitten</b>

20:08.070 --> 20:09.240
I...

20:13.510 --> 20:18.100
I've been called cold and
 stoic ever since I was a child.

20:18.580 --> 20:21.280
I never had any particularly close friends.

20:22.290 --> 20:27.930
I'd assumed the entire rest of
 my life would be like that...

20:29.140 --> 20:31.360
But I feel like something's changed.

20:33.280 --> 20:35.280
Because I met you.

20:40.290 --> 20:43.720
I'm a descendant of a snow woman.

20:44.500 --> 20:48.030
When I become emotional, 
I produce snow and ice.

20:48.030 --> 20:50.300
I gave up on so many things because of that,

20:50.300 --> 20:53.120
and assumed I'd never have any part in them.

20:55.690 --> 21:01.610
I thought I'd never have plants, 
go to the beach, or pet a cat.

21:01.610 --> 21:05.700
But... I've been able to change, as well.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.320
Because I met you.

21:12.770 --> 21:14.120
And I'm so glad I did.

21:19.360 --> 21:23.420
I meant to eat this on the trip, but I forgot.

21:24.590 --> 21:26.590
<b>Konbu</b>

21:24.950 --> 21:25.920
Here.

21:27.440 --> 21:29.000
Thank you!

21:37.710 --> 21:39.050
Shall we?

21:39.050 --> 21:40.090
Yes.

21:45.450 --> 21:47.330
We're back!

21:47.330 --> 21:49.020
Hey, great timing!

21:49.020 --> 21:51.000
Are you guys free this weekend?

21:51.000 --> 21:53.560
We're making plans for flower-viewing.

21:53.560 --> 21:56.620
We're gonna have a grand old time!

21:58.280 --> 21:59.930
Oh, and...

22:00.670 --> 22:02.710
Welcome home!

22:03.470 --> 22:04.680
We're home.
